  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Refugee contract - UNHCR: Refugee Sustainable Responses: Supporting Thailand&#xbf;s Transition to Self-Reliance &amp; Inclusion</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract related to: Refugee contract - UNHCR: Refugee Sustainable Responses: Supporting Thailand&#xbf;s Transition to Self-Reliance &amp; Inclusion - The action aims to support the displaced Myanmar populations who currently reside in camps in Thailand and along the border with Myanmar. The specific objectives are: &#xbf; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;SO1: Provision of basic services to the refugee populations; &#xbf;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;SO2: Improvement of governance through sector-based interventions, leading to more self-reliant and empowered refugees, including the most vulnerable;&#xbf;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;SO3: Improvement of livelihood opportunities and skills of refugees in preparation of durable solutions.</narrative>
  </description>
